--Description: 10) Sanity-check: approximate how many trips fall outside the 0–60-minute range.
--We apply a 5 % sample, count the non-conforming rows, and scale the result to estimate
--the total.  (Multiply by 20 because a 5 % sample ≈ 1⁄20 of the full set.)
